WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.250
- Well, well, well.

00:00:01.375 --> 00:00:04.500
Ol' Herbstreit believes players should serve their time.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.125
- Not so fast, my friend.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:08.541
- No, please! You’re going against conventional draft wisdom!

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:10.500
- Make like me in the preseason…

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:11.791
Drop 'em.

00:00:13.291 --> 00:00:15.250
- Hop on the bandwagon! It’s crowded now.

00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:16.375
- What’s good, bro?

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:16.750
- Hey, Joe.

00:00:17.041 --> 00:00:18.041
- Oh, hello. Pleasure.

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:25.541
- So I said to them, if the Titans are a one seed, I’d hate to see what a seven seed is.

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:25.875
- [Chuckling]

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:27.541
- The Bengals have officially arrived!

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.625
- Can’t have a party without Uno Chase and the Cincinnati kid.

00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:34.750
- Sorry. We don’t normally let Ohio teams make the playoffs in back-to-back years.

00:00:35.041 --> 00:00:36.750
- I could win a shootout. I’m an actual cowboy.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.750
- Shhhh, we’re a defensive team now.

00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:40.375
- Wait, that’s the man who beat us.

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:42.250
We used to be the fun team!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.000
- [Together:] Not our precious Chiefs!

00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:45.625
- Time to Mixon it up and run.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:46.916
- [Offscreen:] WHO DEY?

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:47.875
- Nobody.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.375
- Wait, this is Cincinnati? I feel like the Bengals stole our—

00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:52.250
- It’s a whole thing. Taysom, JUST DRIVE.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.000
- Today’s Zac Snack: more chili!

00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:55.625
- [Derek Carr:] WE'RE HERE TO RAID!

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:57.166
And I swear we're open to a tie.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.291
- What do you think, Uno?

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.666
- I’ve eaten a lot of chili...

00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:01.166
so it’s time to air it out.

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:04.083
- Are they posing?
- Man, they're cool!

00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:05.500
- I’M CIRCLING THE WAGON!

00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:12.791
- WILL UNO CHASE AND THE CINCINNATI KID COLLAPSE IN THE PLAYOFFS LIKE THE BENGALS OF OLD?

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.875
DID GRIDIRON HEIGHTS JUST CURSE  CINCINNATI LIKE THEY DID…

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.166
 THE 2018 BEARS, 

00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:18.500
THE 2019 BILLS,

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.166
AND THE 2020 BEARS?

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:24.000
AND WILL ZAC TAYLOR MAKE ENOUGH FOOD FOR HIS HUNGRY LADS?!

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.041
FIND OUT NEXT WEEK ON GRIDIRON HEIGHTS!

